### Block a spam number with a busy tone
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inbound-caller-rules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "phonePrefix": "998901112233", "action": "BLOCK_BUSY", "note": "spam" }

### Refuse callers who hide their number, with a message
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inbound-caller-rules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "phonePrefix": "ANONYMOUS", "action": "BLOCK_MESSAGE", "message": "Iltimos, raqamingizni yashirmasdan qayta qo'ng'iroq qiling." }

### A VIP client goes first in every queue
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inbound-caller-rules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "phonePrefix": "998935550000", "action": "VIP", "note": "Katta investor" }

### List
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inbound-caller-rules/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{}
